WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.510
16 and 17 July 1942,

2
00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:09.350
in Paris. French police
arrest 13,152 Jews.

3
00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:13.330
Among them are 4,115 children.

4
00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:16.510
Families are held for
days in a cycling stadium,

5
00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:18.440
the «Vélodrome d'Hiver».

6
00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:20.960
In French, this is «une rafle»:

7
00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:24.680
a round-up. Paris was
under German occupation.

8
00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:27.350
So why did the French state take part?

9
00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:31.610
In this mission, you'll map
France as it was divided in 1940:

10
00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:33.630
«la zone occupée», «la zone libre»,

11
00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:35.570
and the line between them.

12
00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:38.240
Then you'll build a
timeline of persecution,

13
00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:39.840
and ask of each measure:

14
00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:41.210
who ordered it?

15
00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:44.750
Your mission: find out who
decided what, and when.
